- A static tool schema that cannot be compiled fails registration and names the tool. ([validated by: rejects an uncompilable schema during registration](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L1))
- A function-valued definition is resolved for each call, so each call is validated against its current schema. ([validated by: validates function-valued definitions against the schema current at each call](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L1))

